        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ram kathum khou lat nzan,",
            "Tingkao Raguangh jisu ta;",
            "Kalat nzanpui bam khou;",
            "Kalan zingbang naidat kan makhe.",
            "",
            "Ai rui thuan ku e jisu,",
            "Katik kagun daipui ram khou,",
            "Nang bangta zauzianc lou o,",
            "Ryanra ryanriu puibam kathui khou.",
            "",
            "2. Dui le kandih ting kao khou ,",
            "Kalat nzan pui bam khou;",
            "Jisu thei ai lai tad ni,",
            "Tingkao kandi khou bam cham ni the.",
            "",
            "3. Thing kros ru khou khang kan the,",
            "Kanloumei jisu khrista ,",
            "Rianra rian riu mei guai tei,",
            "Kum ma rianra rian riu khang kan the.",
            "",
            "4. Rom mei rihmei nun guay rui,",
            "Sinhnui na Pouta zai tat,",
            "Tikih mei nun rui nuh lou mak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
